cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Angelica in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Angelica"
abstract: >
  Angelica is an open-source platform for steady, incompressible, isothermal
  pipe network simulation. It solves for nodal pressures and component flow
  rates in networks of pipes, fittings, and pumps using a pressure-correction
  algorithm (modified SIMPLE) with Colebrook-White, Hazen-Williams, or
  Poiseuille closures. A graphical network editor is included.
authors:
